Feature: Amazon Purchase Flow 

 Scenario Outline: Login to Amazon
    When User clicks sign in
    And User enters username "<Emailid>" and password "<Password>"
    Then User should login successfully

    Examples:
      | Emailid    | Password    |
      | 8610966352 | password123 |


  
 Scenario Outline: Product search and add to cart
    Given User is on product page
    When User searches product "<ProductName>"
    And User selects first product
    Then Product added to cart successfully

    Examples:
      | ProductName |
      | iphone 15   |


  
 Scenario: Proceed to payment
    When User navigates to cart
    And User clicks proceed to buy
    And User selects delivery address
    Then User proceeds to payment page


  
 Scenario: Add new delivery address
    When User goes back to delivery address page
    And    User clicks change address
    And    User adds new address with "<Name>" "<Mobile>" "<Pincode>" "<Address>" "<City>"
    Then   Address should be saved successfull

Examples:
   | Emailid                    | Name     | Mobile      | Pincode | Address           | City     |
   | 8610966352                 | Preeth | 8610966352  | 600001  | Anna Nagar, Block | Chennai   |
   
 
 Scenario:  Edit existing delivery address
    When   User goes back to  edit delivery address page
    And    User clicks change address
    And User edit address
    And User edits address with "<InvalidName>" "<InvalidMobile>" "<InvalidPincode>" "<InvalidAddress>"
    Then   Address should be saved successfull

Examples:
| EmailId     | Password     | InvalidName | InvalidMobile | InvalidPincode | InvalidAddress |
| 8610966352  | password123 | aaaaaaaa    | 0000000000   | 111111         | Test Invalid   |



 
Scenario Outline: Invalid product search
  When User navigates back five times
   Given User is on product page
  When User searches product "<ProductName>"
  Then No results message should be displayed
   Examples:
  |   ProductName     | 
  |   abcdefr521      |
  
  
  
Scenario: Logout from Amazon
  When User logs out
  Then User should be logged out successfully
 
   
